      "role": "user",
      "content": "the hotline thing feels so useless though. like, i've done the talking and the breathing exercises and the \"it gets better\" stuff. it's not a crisis, it's just... the reality. it's just that i'm fundamentally done. i feel like i've reached the end of a road and there's just a cliff ahead. it's not even scary anymore, it just looks peaceful. like the only way to actually stop the noise and the heaviness is to just... stop altogether.",
